---
title: "Uploading a private file"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: done
    lg1: blocked
    lg2: active
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 pink
  class lg2 blue
  s0: Choose a file
  s1: Asking the server for an upload slot
  s2: Failed before anything was sent
  s3: Sending the file
  s4: Asking the server to finish
  s5: Failed while sending: server copy stays pending
  s6: Failed after the bytes arrived: server copy stays pending
  s7: Upload complete, page reloads
  s8: Failed before sending, and an earlier server copy stays pending
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you choose the file and submit
  s1 --> s2: the server refuses the upload
  s1 --> s3: the server reserves space
  s2 --> s1: you try again
  s3 --> s4: the file is sent
  s3 --> s5: sending the file fails
  s4 --> s6: finishing the upload fails
  s4 --> s7: the server marks the file ready
  s5 --> s1: you try again
  s6 --> s1: you try again
  s1 --> s8: the server refuses the upload
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 pink
  class s3 blue
  class s4 blue
  class s5 pink
  class s6 pink
  class s7 teal
  class s8 pink
